{"id":6,"date":"2026-08-05T08:40:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-05T08:40:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/?page_id=6"},"modified":"2026-10-25T18:50:21","modified_gmt":"2026-10-25T18:50:21","slug":"about","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/about\/","title":{"rendered":"Our Story"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-editorial alignfull is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<section class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-hero is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full bakly-about-hero__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1575\" src=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Assorted breads and pastries arranged on a dark baking surface.\" class=\"wp-image-981\" srcset=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-scaled.jpg 2560w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-300x185.jpg 300w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-1024x630.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-768x473.jpg 768w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-1536x945.jpg 1536w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-2048x1260.jpg 2048w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/brands-people-yHjcZCaiKFY-unsplash-600x369.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-hero__eyebrow bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">Pastry \/ cake \/ bread<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-hero__note bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">A closer look at the shapes, textures, and small pleasures found across Ch\u00e9rie&#8217;s bakery menu.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-hero__scroll bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"#about-layers\">Scroll to explore<\/a><\/p>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<section id=\"about-layers\" class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter bakly-about-chapter--warm is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter__inner is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"bakly-about-chapter__label bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">01 \/ Texture &amp; form<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter__intro is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading bakly-about-reveal\">Good things have layers.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">A familiar shape rewards a closer look. The menu includes Deluxe Croissant among its pastry options, alongside cakes and breads. This photograph pauses on the familiar shape of a croissant: folds, light across the crust, and shadow between its curves.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-feature is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full bakly-about-feature__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1738\" src=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"A golden croissant on a white ceramic plate.\" class=\"wp-image-983\" srcset=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-scaled.jpg 2560w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-300x204.jpg 300w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-1024x695.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-768x522.jpg 768w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-1536x1043.jpg 1536w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-2048x1391.jpg 2048w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/jocelyn-morales-qqIj5pV48-s-unsplash-1-600x407.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-feature__copy bakly-about-reveal is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A study in folds<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The photograph holds on the light across the crust, the rhythm of each fold, and the shadow between its curves.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-feature__caption wp-block-paragraph\">A closer look <span>01 \u2014 03<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<section id=\"about-craft\" class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter__inner is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"bakly-about-chapter__label bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">02 \/ The finishing touch<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter__intro is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading bakly-about-reveal\">A little detail goes a long way.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">A swirl of icing. A toasted edge. A gloss of chocolate. The finishing touch gives a bake its own character\u2014and invites the eye to linger before the first bite.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-feature bakly-about-feature--reverse is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full bakly-about-feature__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Pastry chef piping a finishing detail in a bakery kitchen.\" class=\"wp-image-984\" srcset=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-scaled.jpg 1707w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-200x300.jpg 200w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-683x1024.jpg 683w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-768x1152.jpg 768w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-1365x2048.jpg 1365w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/diliara-garifullina-Gx_vsiMRgzk-unsplash-600x900.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1707px) 100vw, 1707px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-feature__copy bakly-about-reveal is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A moment of making<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this frame, a pastry chef adds a finishing detail. The photograph holds on the focused hands and one small, deliberate gesture.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-feature__caption wp-block-paragraph\">The finishing touch <span>02 \u2014 03<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n\n\n<section id=\"about-table\" class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter bakly-about-chapter--dark is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter__inner is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"bakly-about-chapter__label bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">03 \/ Made to be shared<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-chapter__intro is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading bakly-about-reveal\">Bring something lovely to the table.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-reveal wp-block-paragraph\">The menu moves from the Deluxe Croissant to Banana Bread, Chocolate \u00c9clair, and Strawberry Cupcake. Different shapes, familiar pleasures, and plenty of reasons to choose a favourite.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-feature bakly-about-feature--portrait is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full bakly-about-feature__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Lemon meringue pie with toasted meringue and a browned crust.\" class=\"wp-image-982\" srcset=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-scaled.jpg 1707w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-200x300.jpg 200w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-683x1024.jpg 683w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-768x1152.jpg 768w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-1365x2048.jpg 1365w, http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/alexander-mils-aiIANaSK9DQ-unsplash-600x900.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1707px) 100vw, 1707px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-feature__copy bakly-about-reveal is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A table worth returning to.<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Start with a favourite from the menu, or find a new one. There is something here for a pause, a celebration, or a table with room for one more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"bakly-about-feature__caption wp-block-paragraph\">Lemon meringue pie \/ for the love of contrast<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group bakly-about-cta-row bakly-about-reveal is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find your next favourite in Ch\u00e9rie&#8217;s bakery menu.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button bakly-about-cta\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http:\/\/bakery.local\/our-menu\/\">Explore the menu<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pastry \/ cake \/ bread A closer look at the shapes, textures, and small pleasures found across Ch\u00e9rie&#8217;s bakery menu. Scroll to explore 01 \/ Texture &amp; form Good things have layers. A familiar shape rewards a closer look. The menu includes Deluxe Croissant among its pastry options, alongside cakes and breads. This photograph pauses [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-6","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":990,"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/6\/revisions\/990"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/bakery.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6"}],"curies":[{"name":"w